    </div><div class="section-20">
      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8f5" class="h2-prix">Questions we receive through our <span class="gradient-text">customer support:</span></h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8fb-7582ef80" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8fb" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I contact Innovorder support?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our teams are available by phone, chat, WhatsApp, email, or through our Help Center.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb914-7582ef80" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb914" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the hours of operation?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Because the restaurant business never stops, neither do we. Our teams are here to assist you 7 days a week: Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. to 10 p.m., Saturday from 10 a.m. to 9 p.m., and Sundays and holidays from 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb925-7582ef80" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb925" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I reach an advisor directly by phone?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, the phone is the best way to reach us in an emergency. We’ll answer your call within two minutes, even when we’re at our busiest.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb930-7582ef80" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb930" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How long does it take to get a response?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Support is all about responsiveness.<br><strong>- Phone</strong>: Less than 2 minutes.<br><strong>- Chat &amp; WhatsApp</strong>: As soon as possible.<br><strong>- Email: </strong> Immediate confirmation and a detailed response within the same day.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-e7fb8200-c784-415e-af92-b4e41534d720-7582ef80" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
